                        ],
                        "form": "патоло́гии"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "c2d3a3ce-9a44-4cd2-b150-f69af123de7d",
                        "entry_id": "563ab25c-9af3-30e0-98f5-f32c89094df4",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "патоло́гиях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d01f605e-9b78-3056-907c-361910c09f2f",
                        "entry_id": "563ab25c-9af3-30e0-98f5-f32c89094df4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "мед. отклонение от нормального состояния или процесса развития"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "29186c7c-bc39-4f7f-9599-48ab31b90ba7",
                                "sense_id": "d01f605e-9b78-3056-907c-361910c09f2f",
                                "text": "Следует отметить, что словом «патология» обозначают также любое отклонение от нормы."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f6243967-4749-4525-8f5c-663ebfad4799",
                                "sense_id": "d01f605e-9b78-3056-907c-361910c09f2f",
                                "text": "Мазня в середине цикла — это патология, довольно часто встречающаяся у многих женщин всех возрастов."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e062ab8-3b05-46e2-be31-71a555078f1f",
                                "sense_id": "d01f605e-9b78-3056-907c-361910c09f2f",
                                "text": "Степень выраженности патологии развития плода может быть различная."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5024eff4-0592-3fa8-b79a-959bb1d94c3a",
                        "entry_id": "563ab25c-9af3-30e0-98f5-f32c89094df4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "наука, изучающая закономерности возникновения, течения и исхода заболеваний и отдельных патологических процессов в организме человека и животных"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "75b49c7c-f57e-41a1-8012-e0d5a8fb8dff",
                                "sense_id": "5024eff4-0592-3fa8-b79a-959bb1d94c3a",
                                "text": "Истоки медицинской патологии можно найти в древнем мире, как умозрительное учение о гуморальной (от лат. humor — влага, жидкость) и солидарной (от лат. solidus — плотный) патологии."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4e5852dc-5c96-469f-b650-46ae4885bda2",
                                "sense_id": "5024eff4-0592-3fa8-b79a-959bb1d94c3a",
                                "text": "Общая патология изучает наиболее общие закономерности патологических процессов, которые лежат в основе болезни независимо от вызвавшей ее причины, индивидуальных особенностей организма, специфических условий окружающей среды и др."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "007ea4d6-68cb-4858-b315-05a4ed63b527",
                                "sense_id": "5024eff4-0592-3fa8-b79a-959bb1d94c3a",
                                "text": "Кафедра психиатрии, психотерапии и психосоматической патологии."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2a73ea52-9b0b-4794-aa37-b7c7b9f5faa3",
                        "source_entry_id": "563ab25c-9af3-30e0-98f5-f32c89094df4",
                        "source_sense_description": "отклонение",
                        "target_lang_word": "pathology",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pathology",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca19632b-8eb4-3ad8-bbf2-394af4e7e280",
                                        "entry_id": "fa0f5178-3d47-35ae-b78f-3a453317efb7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The study of the nature of disease and its causes, processes, development, and consequences; now usually and especially in the clinical and academic medicine subsenses defined below.",
                                            "The clinical biomedical specialty that provides microscopy and other laboratory services to clinicians (e.g., cytology, histology, cytopathology, histopathology, cytometry)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "220ed30f-1202-4530-9b1e-ab0210206e4e",
                                                "sense_id": "ca19632b-8eb4-3ad8-bbf2-394af4e7e280",
                                                "text": "The surgeon sent a specimen of the cyst to the hospital's pathology department for staining and analysis to determine its histologic subtype."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c6d3eb12-b6dd-3830-8b63-7b78fcd7a16c",
                                        "entry_id": "fa0f5178-3d47-35ae-b78f-3a453317efb7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The study of the nature of disease and its causes, processes, development, and consequences; now usually and especially in the clinical and academic medicine subsenses defined below.",
                                            "The academic biomedical specialty that advances the aspects of the biomedical sciences that allow for those clinical applications and their advancements over time."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "literary",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b901ef8b-80db-403f-bce8-3cc2397be22d",
                                                "sense_id": "c6d3eb12-b6dd-3830-8b63-7b78fcd7a16c",
                                                "text": "Those three pioneering pathologists went on to become leaders in building the pathology departments at several universities."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "da1095ff-27ab-31ee-91ba-254402cbb552",
                                        "entry_id": "fa0f5178-3d47-35ae-b78f-3a453317efb7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The study of the nature of disease and its causes, processes, development, and consequences; now usually and especially in the clinical and academic medicine subsenses defined below.",
                                            "Any of several interrelated scientific disciplines that advance the aspects of the life sciences that allow for such technological applications and their advancements over time."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e451d96c-6b15-4b3e-91d3-366b7b536655",
                                                "sense_id": "da1095ff-27ab-31ee-91ba-254402cbb552",
                                                "text": "the plant pathology and vertebrate pathology programs of the university's biology department"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c8e11933-3415-3df2-acd7-9b59ee09ba37",
                                        "entry_id": "fa0f5178-3d47-35ae-b78f-3a453317efb7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pathosis: any deviation from a healthy or normal structure or function; abnormality; illness or malformation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e474a4ea-8f99-4d42-b3c3-a4703ffa735d",
                                                "sense_id": "c8e11933-3415-3df2-acd7-9b59ee09ba37",
                                                "text": "Some sort of renal pathology was suspected, but imaging and even biopsy found no discernible pathology, glomerular or otherwise."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "980b832e-da60-4288-a1d5-4491bdea9228",
                                                "sense_id": "c8e11933-3415-3df2-acd7-9b59ee09ba37",
                                                "text": "Some sort of mental and social pathology seemed to sweep over the discourse later that autumn."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "249bcddf-b81b-45ec-be6b-1f81846c0ddf",
                        "source_entry_id": "563ab25c-9af3-30e0-98f5-f32c89094df4",
                        "source_sense_description": "отклонение",
                        "target_lang_word": "Pathologie",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Pathologie",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "594c16d2-4c7f-3dcc-96c9-2de2b36018dc",
                                        "entry_id": "73fdbaca-603d-3026-bf42-2530f43f7bb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "medizinische Disziplin, die sich mit der Erforschung von Entstehung, Herkunft, Wirkung und Verlauf von Krankheiten, sowie mit Missbildungen beschäftigt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eab5bd15-764e-4f57-a849-98f3390a3de8",
                                                "sense_id": "594c16d2-4c7f-3dcc-96c9-2de2b36018dc",
                                                "text": "Jeder Medizinstudent muss sich im Laufe seines Studiums mit der Pathologie beschäftigen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "821c16b4-9f52-4d90-a4d3-4f0587c61746",
                                                "sense_id": "594c16d2-4c7f-3dcc-96c9-2de2b36018dc",
                                                "text": "„Seine Leber soll der Pathologie Beweise über eine ans Wunderbare grenzende Widerstandfähigkeit gegenüber dem Alkohol geliefert haben.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "207a5e10-4116-4e92-aed6-ee333d33224d",
                                                "sense_id": "594c16d2-4c7f-3dcc-96c9-2de2b36018dc",
                                                "text": "„So saß ich und sann, bis mir so gefährliche Gedanken in den Kopf kamen, daß ich aufsprang und zu meinem Schreibtisch eilte, wo ich mich, um auf andere Gedanken zu kommen, in die neueste Abhandlung über Pathologie stürzte.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "99e2dc30-c9ff-35ad-aae2-e872d11b0bf7",
                                        "entry_id": "73fdbaca-603d-3026-bf42-2530f43f7bb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Institut, in dem pathologische Forschung betrieben wird"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32d99a36-d694-480c-a394-02db2388ddad",
                                                "sense_id": "99e2dc30-c9ff-35ad-aae2-e872d11b0bf7",
                                                "text": "Die Leiche wurde in die Pathologie gebracht."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "21f68cf3-2ac6-48a3-8096-45c283b4745a",
                                                "sense_id": "99e2dc30-c9ff-35ad-aae2-e872d11b0bf7",
                                                "text": "„In der Kluft konnte man füttern, waschen und in der Pathologie vorbeischauen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
